    <string name="chat_initial_message">Hi! I\'m Nova, your personal AI health coach. I\'m here to help you reach your goals — nutrition, fitness, weight, and more. What can I help you with today?</string>
    <string name="chat_quick_dinner">What should I eat for dinner?</string>
    <string name="chat_quick_on_track">Am I on track today?</string>
    <string name="chat_quick_workout">Suggest a workout</string>
    <string name="chat_quick_protein">How much protein do I need?</string>
    <string name="chat_quick_calories">Analyze my calories</string>
    <string name="chat_ai_response_1">Great question! Based on your calorie data today, a high-protein dinner would be ideal. Try grilled chicken breast with quinoa and roasted vegetables — around 500 kcal and 40g of protein.</string>
    <string name="chat_ai_response_2">You\'re doing well! You\'ve consumed 1,420 kcal of your 2,000 kcal goal. You have 580 kcal remaining and you\'ve burned 340 through walking. Keep it up!</string>
    <string name="chat_ai_response_3">For today, I\'d suggest a 30-minute moderate walk — you\'ve already done 7,240 steps, so you\'re close to your 10,000 goal. Or try a 20-minute yoga session to wind down.</string>
    <string name="chat_ai_response_4">Based on your weight and activity level, you need approximately 130–150g of protein daily. Great sources include chicken, eggs, Greek yogurt, and legumes.</string>
    <string name="chat_ai_response_5">Your macros look balanced today. Protein is at 61%, carbs at 72%, and fat at 68% of your goals. Protein could use a small boost — add a snack like cottage cheese or a protein shake.</string>

